# Directory Structure

Complete directory layout for the Sasha Sales AI project.

## Root Directory

```
sasha-ai-agent-langGraph/
├── .cursor/                    # Cursor IDE configuration
│   └── rules/                  # Cursor rules (this folder)
├── src/                        # Source code
│   └── sasha_sales_ai/         # Main package
├── tests/                      # Test suite
├── docker-compose.yml          # Production Docker setup
├── docker-compose.dev.yml      # Development Docker setup (hot reload)
├── Dockerfile                  # Container build instructions
├── pyproject.toml              # Python project metadata
├── requirements.txt            # Python dependencies
└── README.md                   # Project documentation
```

## Source Code Structure

```
src/sasha_sales_ai/
├── __init__.py                 # Package initialization
├── main.py                     # FastAPI application entry point
├── config.py                   # Pydantic settings & environment config
├── state.py                    # FlowState TypedDict definition
├── graph.py                    # LangGraph workflow definition
├── flow_manager.py             # FlowManager class for state operations
├── validators.py               # Requirement validation logic
├── logging_config.py           # Logging configuration
│
├── api/                        # REST API layer
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── models.py               # Pydantic request/response models
│   └── routes.py               # FastAPI route definitions
│
├── chains/                     # LangChain chains (LLM interactions)
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── lead_analyzer.py        # Lead analysis & intent classification
│   ├── email_writer.py         # Email generation chain
│   └── pricing_expert.py       # Pricing calculation chain
│
├── nodes/                      # LangGraph node functions
│   ├── __init__.py             # Exports all nodes
│   ├── ingest.py               # Email ingestion node
│   ├── understand.py           # Lead understanding node
│   ├── reply.py                # Reply processing node
│   ├── feasibility.py          # Feasibility check node
│   ├── pricing.py              # Pricing calculation node
│   ├── quote.py                # Quote generation node
│   ├── clarification.py        # Clarification request node
│   ├── confirmation.py         # Order confirmation node
│   ├── order.py                # Order placement node
│   ├── approval.py             # Approval handling node
│   ├── rejection.py            # Rejection handling node
│   └── error_handler.py        # Error handling node (stops flow)
│
├── prompts/                    # LLM prompt configurations
│   ├── __init__.py
