## Key Files Reference

### Entry Points
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `main.py` | FastAPI app initialization, lifespan management |
| `graph.py` | LangGraph workflow definition with nodes and edges |
| `flow_manager.py` | State management, graph invocation |

### Configuration
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `config.py` | Settings class with env vars (Redis, OpenAI, etc.) |
| `state.py` | `FlowState` TypedDict, enums (`FlowStatus`, `CustomerIntent`) |
| `validators.py` | Required fields, validation rules |

### LLM Logic
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `chains/lead_analyzer.py` | `analyze_lead()`, `classify_reply_intent()` |
| `chains/email_writer.py` | `generate_email()` for all email types |
| `chains/pricing_expert.py` | `calculate_pricing()` with context |

### Prompt Configuration
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `prompts/agents.yaml` | Agent roles, goals, backstories |
| `prompts/tasks.yaml` | Task descriptions, product catalog |

### Storage
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `storage/redis_store.py` | `RedisStateStore` for lead states |
| `storage/rag_storage.py` | `RAGStorage` for document retrieval |

## Import Patterns

```python
# Configuration
from sasha_sales_ai.config import get_settings

# State
from sasha_sales_ai.state import FlowState, FlowStatus, CustomerIntent

# Chains
from sasha_sales_ai.chains.lead_analyzer import analyze_lead, classify_reply_intent
from sasha_sales_ai.chains.email_writer import generate_email

# Nodes
from sasha_sales_ai.nodes import understand_lead, process_reply, place_order

# Storage
from sasha_sales_ai.storage import RedisStateStore, get_redis_store

# Utilities
from sasha_sales_ai.utils import log_state_before, log_state_after, get_tracing_context
```
